context-optimizer-title = Local context optimizer
context-optimizer-budget-title = Explicit local-token budget
context-optimizer-budget-hint = 64–1000000 Unicode word-boundary tokens for packet plus mandatory notes. Enter previews; Esc cancels. Not the entire provider prompt or a provider token budget.
